0 dyno-geared (Brickwright Robot Lab validation machine, round 2)
0 Name: dyno-geared.ldr
0 Author: Brickwright
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Brake dynamometer through an 8:24 mesh (Robot Lab validation round 2): the SPIKE medium motor (port A) output
0 // up at the origin, a Technic beam 7 pinned under its housing (u0/u1). An 8T 3647 on a 3L axle in the output at
0 // y = -60 drives the white 24T slip-clutch gear 76019 on an 8L axle in the beam's hole at x = 40 (pitch radii
0 // 10 + 30). The test holds that axle: the clutch's ring turns at a third of the motor's speed and slips on its
0 // hub at the stamped torque, which the mesh brings to the motor as a third.
